# venueplay.com.au cache rules (Cloudflare Pages).
#
# This site had no _headers file, which is why new deploys only showed up in an
# incognito window: browsers were serving the old cached HTML. The rule below makes
# every page and app file revalidate with the server before it is used, so venues
# always get the latest version (a quick 304 when nothing changed).
#
# We use "no-cache" (revalidate), not "no-store" (never cache), on purpose: the home
# page and the musical game load /data/musical-library.json in the browser, and
# no-store would force that whole file to download again every single time.

/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate

# Brand logos never change under a given filename, so cache them hard for a year.
/logos/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
